      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is a GSRTC tracker an official GSRTC product?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Usually not. \"GSRTC tracker\" describes a category of transit tools — official and independent — that show where a Gujarat ST bus is right now. ST Tracker is an independent, ad-supported public utility built by Shivrajsinh Zala, displaying official AIS-140 GPS telematics across 8,554+ buses without requiring an account or app store download."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What data does a GSRTC tracker actually use?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "It reads live AIS-140 GPS telematics broadcast by on-board tracking units fitted to each GSRTC bus, refreshed every 20 seconds during active trips. A tracker's job is parsing that stream and projecting it on an interactive map alongside route stops and dynamic ETAs."
